window.products.push({"id":1162167,"name":"Root Boutique 12-Inch Unscented Hand-dipped Taper Candles, Garnet Red, Box of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IE2xf0BdL._AC_.jpg","description":"For centuries, tapered candles have been formed by meticulously hand-dipping. Root takes this traditional process to another level by continuously dipping our tapers to create up to 35 individual layers of wax. The result is a satin-like finish with solid, consistently colored, unscented wax throughout. Our timeless observation: You can't rush perfection. Hand-dipped taper candles are 12-inch tall and have a burn time of approximately 12-hour each. Whether it's a romantic dinner for two on your backyard patio or a formal dinner party with your best china and linens, set the mood and illuminate the occasion with the understated elegance of Root Dinner candles. Since 1869, Root Candles of Medina, Ohio, has been an industry-leading, family-owned company renowned for innovative ideas, aesthetic enhancements and the highest standards of quality. Now in its fifth generation, the Root family continues to extol the virtues of honesty, integrity, and diligent craftsmanship. These qualities were exemplified by Root Candles founding father and American original, Amos Ives Root. His tradition of excellence, along with a genuine commitment to customer satisfaction and service, defines and fuels Root's strong brand loyalty today. Root Candles devotion to purity, honesty and quality is renowned. Each Root candle is carefully handcrafted using processes mastered through five generations of craftsmanship combined with the latest in manufacturing technologies. The results are pure and simple: Root Candles are highly regarded for complex bouquets of subtle fragrances and sophisticated color palettes, important factors for discerning candle lovers. Today, Root Candles can confidently lay claim to making \"the best candles in America.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IE2xf0BdL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Root Candles","source_asin":"B005K4O66U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1162167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005K4O66U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005K4O66U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1162168,"name":"Snughome Coffee Pod Holder for K Cups, Coffee Pod Storage Organizer with Large Capacity, Coffee Pods Holder for Nespresso Vertuo Capsule, K Cup Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wxfH0ld2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Sturdy & Simple Design] The combination of rustic particle board and matte black metal mesh makes the design simple and practical. Place it next to any pod coffee maker, immediately find it blend into the office environment and kitchen decor. The pod storage organizer is very suitable for dormitory, kitchen countertops or office coffee bar. Let this durable coffee pod holder reflect your taste. [Organized Display & Space Saving] The capacity of coffee pod holder is twice that of ordinary coffee capsule holder, providing you with enough storage space. Make your kitchen or office look well organized. For different types of coffee capsules, coffee pods and snacks, a large-capacity coffee pod holder is a pretty choice. Your quality coffee deserves quality storage. [Assemble & Clean Easily] We have detailed installation instructions and sufficient accessories. Installation only requires internal screws to fix, so installation is not a difficult task for you. The smooth, waterproof surface of particle board is very easy to clean. Please wipe with a damp cloth and towel dry. [Large Capacity] Dimensions: 9.84\"L x 5.9\"W x 6.73\"H; the coffee pod holder stores a lot of coffee pods without taking much counter space, holds 50+ k cups, 70+ vertuo pods, or 150+ original capsules. The wide opening of the coffee pod holder is at a convenient angle for easy access. Keep your pods handy. [Satisfaction Service] Snughome always provides excellent worry-free after sales service.If you have any problems before buying or when you are using our products, please do not hesitate to contact us, we promise that we will provide satisfactory service to every customer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wxfH0ld2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Snughome","source_asin":"B09K7JQS1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1162168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7JQS1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7JQS1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1162169,"name":"DII Heavyweight Kitchen Towel, Tango Red, Set of 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LyVhH5TgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring color into your kitchen with dii's hard working tango red heavyweight kitchen essentials dish towel set of 3. Each set features 3 matching towels in an interesting tone-on-tone pattern. You will always have a great, super absorbent, and dependable towel close at hand. These colorful towels come in coordinating shades and patterns that complement any kitchen. Coordinates with kitchen essentials kitchen towel set of 5 in tango red. Consider the entire kitchen essentials collection for a complete functional and colorful kitchen. Each towel measures 18-inch by 28-inch and are 100-percent cotton and machine washable. Browse through all of design imports products for more ideas for colorful, functional kitchen solutions for the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LyVhH5TgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DII","source_asin":"B0028RXDMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1162169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0028RXDMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0028RXDMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
