window.products.push({"id":1162185,"name":"Christmas Decorations, 12PCS Happy New Year Decoration LED Candles, LED Window Candle with Remote Control for Christmas Decor Happy New Year Party Sup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819syBR40wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【12 PCS CHRISTMAS DECORATION CANDLES】The package has 12 flameless taper candles, 12PCS hooks and fishing wires. Each candle requires 2 x AA batteries (Not included), size at 6.7'' x0.8'' inches, which can be used anywhere to decorate your room, adding a warm white and romantic ambiance. 【A GREAT DECORATION FOR CHRISTMAS PARTY】These battery operated taper candles with warm white flickering light. You can hang these Christmas decoration candles with fishing wire on the ceiling(or window) to create the effect of a floating candle for a Movie Theme party. Creating a joyful ambiance for your Happy New Year party, making your party unique and unforgettable. 【REMOTE CONTROL LED CANDLE LIGHT】The simple remote designs keep the battery for maximum durability, allowing you to control them with a remote control when you hang them from a high place. This prevents frequent battery changes or switching the lights on or off. It's more convenient when providing you with a thrilling atmosphere. 【HOW TO USE】Twist off the bottom of candle, then insert 2*AA batteries into the taper led candle (The positive electrode is up, the negative electrode is down). And tighten the bottom cap until the light on. 【STRICT QUALITY CONTROL & IDEAL DECORATION】Techops flameless flickering candles are made of high quality materials and they have been strict quality controlled. If you have any questions during the use, please feel free to contact us through customer service. These handheld flickering battery candles are perfect for Halloween decor, dinner table, church service, birthday, wedding, fireplace, Christmas decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819syBR40wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techops","source_asin":"B0B79JK483","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1162185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B79JK483","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B79JK483","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
