window.products.push({"id":1162275,"name":"Fancyarn Cloud Shoe Storage Bench, 100% Solid Beech Wood, 23.6'' Shoe Rack Bench w/Washable Cushion, No Assembly, Strong Wood Structure, Hold Up to 44","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VCJwRCzvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Precious Solid Beech Wood w/ Simple Design] Made of precious FAS grade beech wood, this Fancyarn shoe bench is more durable, ecological, and has a fresh wood finish with a greater value. Meanwhile, this shoe rack bench has a minimalist design and can match any home decoration. You can embellish your home in a matter of seconds by placing this shoe storage bench in your entryway. Your guests will definitely be impressed when they walk in and see this natural art shoe rack. [Rounded Edge & Firm Structure] Looking at our entryway bench from the side, you will find how lovely the frame of the shoe bench is. The shoe rack has a beautiful arc-shaped edge, which is elegant and can protect your family from being hurt by common sharp metal corners. There are no nails on the whole wooden shoe bench because our bench adopts a mortise and tenon structure, which not only offers a good appearance but also ensures firmness and stability (no wobble and can hold up to 440lb). [No Need to Assemble] Do you hate spending time assembling furniture? Especially if you have to expend your energy assembling a shoe bench when you get tired after work. Compared with other storage benches with complicated assembly steps and tools, our entryway bench will be delivered as a whole and won’t need any assembly. After receiving the shoe rack, you can use the bench immediately, organize your shoes, tidy up your entryway, and then enjoy the rest of your day. [Washable, Thick & Comfortable Cushion] Our shoe bench provides you with a nice, beautiful and comfortable seat. Therefore, a 1 3/4'' thick sponge cushion is added to our wooden bench. You will feel incomparably comfortable as you sit on the bench and change your shoes. Plus, compared to PU leather cushions that can't be separated for cleaning, the cushion of our shoe storage bench is washable, making you far away from being worried about future maintenance issues. [Ideal Size for Various Uses] The size of our wooden shoe storage bench is 23 3/5'' L × 11 4/5'' W × 16 1/2'' H. You can easily put the shoe rack bench in your entryway, living room, bedroom, etc. It is a good option to place this shoe bench in the living room as a storage bench to organize and store your daily items. The ideal height also makes this shoe bench for entryway a comfortable footrest/ottoman for your leisure time. Fancyarn shoe bench will turn your house into a warm home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VCJwRCzvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fancyarn","source_asin":"B0B6P1CQXB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1162275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6P1CQXB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6P1CQXB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
