window.products.push({"id":1162278,"name":"TaTa Topper with Custom Sheet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rrGwnvvyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The TaTaTopper is a foam mattress topper that fits on top of your fitted sheet, on one side of the bed. It has a cut out area for the breasts with inserts so that you can customize the hole to be the size that you need. Your pillow fits at the top of the TaTaTopper. It is easily removeable from your bed and comes with it's own fitted sheet that can be easily removed for washing. The TaTa Topper is 57Lx29Wx4H and made in the USA. From the Manufacturer TaTa Topper 4-inch mattress topper with customizable cutout for your TaTas. Ofers breast relief after a mastectomy, breast surgery or for nursing mothers and large breasted women. The TaTaTopper provides more body suppor than a breast pillow or wedge, thistopper rests on top of your fitted sheet and your pillow fits at the top. Product Details Foam topper is 4-inches thick, 27-inches wide and 59-inches long. Topper rest easily on top of your mattress and can be eaisly removed. It also comes with a custom fitted sheet. Made in the USA. Custom Inserts for your TaTa's Customize your TaTa opening with a series of foam inserts. Comfortably Sleep On Your Stomach You can now sleep comfortably on your stomach thanks to the TaTaTopper. Cut out allows your tatas and drains from surgery to easily fit inside. Nothing touches the sensitive areas so you can sleep soundly and comfortably/ Sleep Soundly On Your Side The TaTa Topper allows you to sleep comfortably on your side and works well for nursing mothers. Comfort For your TaTa's Customized for you to help you sleep better during recovery. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Care. Create. Comfort. How did you come up with the idea for this product? We are friends who found oneanother through our shared journey of having double mastectomies. Sleep is such a big part of recovery and was something we both stuggled with after our surgeries. As side and stomach sleepers, we found it impossible to sleep. At that point, we asked ourselves - how can we fix this and help the millions of women who are either recovering from breast surgeries or dealing with breast related issues? And with that, our TaTaTopper idea was crafted with the help of our families, friends and countless others that we are thankful to now call friends. What makes your product special? The TaTaTopper provides customized sleep solutions for women who are recovering from breast related surgeries, deealing with breast related issues as well as nuring mothers. Unlike body pillows and wedges, this one-of-a-kind product can be customized to fit your size and shape and allows women to sleep comfortably on their side or stomach. The TaTaTopper makes the dream of sleep a reality for millions of women. Made in the USA. What has been the best part of your startup experience? Helping women rest more comfortably. We love hearing customers stories and knowing that we provided relief. That is what motivates us to keep going.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rrGwnvvyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marilyn & Michelle","source_asin":"B00QDA28EC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1162278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QDA28EC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QDA28EC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
