window.products.push({"id":1162683,"name":"Haier HVW18ABS 18-Bottle Wine Cellar, Black and Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41v9KV624+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Tall, sleek, and stylish, this wine tower is the perfect way to keep your favorite reds and whites in peak condition for the best taste and quality. The Basics This Haier wine cellar holds up to 18 bottles in a tall, regal casing. 9 full-width wire chrome storage racks rest inside, keeping your wine supported while displaying the bottles for all to admire. An adjustable mechanical thermostat gives you the freedom to choose the precise temperatures to preserve your wine. This unit is perfect for both red and white wines. The Technology This wine cellar uses Thermal Electric Cooling. Thermal electric (also referred to as semiconductor) wine cellars do not use a compressor and therefore create minimal noise and vibration, keeping wine safe and letting it age better. Besides being extremely quiet, the lack of vibration prevents bubbles from forming in stored wine. This helps preserve the optimum taste of the wine. In addition, thermal electric units have no moving parts, offering high reliability and low maintenance while precisely maintaining the ideal pre-set temperature for wine. Thermal electric technology has no damaging CFC, HCFC or HFC type refrigerants involved in the cooling process. The Look This handsome wine tower is an elegant way to display your wine while keeping it safe. It has a black cabinet outlined by a smooth silver frame, with a double pane insulated glass door. The handle is recessed, creating a sleek outline on the door with no protruding parts. The inside of this wine cellar is black, so your wine bottles will stand out and look their best against the dark background.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41v9KV624+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Haier","source_asin":"B000G3IQ48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1162683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000G3IQ48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000G3IQ48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1162684,"name":"Dreo Space Heaters for Indoor Use, 1500W Fast Heating Ceramic Electric & Portable Heaters with Thermostat, 70° Oscillating with Tip-over & Overheat Pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Jk5gobw2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Up to 75°F in 2 Seconds: Get the warmth 10% with Dreo's Hyperamics technology. 1500W high power transforms your cold room to a hot spot with high-speed heating at up to 9.77 ft/s..Heating Coverage:Up to 200 sq.ft. Warmth That Surrounds: 70° wide-angle heating warms up your room in more widespread directions. 2022 upgraded outlet was fine-tuned 20° downward so the heat travels a longer way, ideal for large rooms like offices, bedrooms and living rooms. Protected by Shield360°: Dreo's Shield360° system provides tip-over and overheat protection, as well as 24-hour auto off protection. Made with V-0 flame-retardant materials, this ETL-listed space heater also has a bend-proof safety plug that ensures ultimate safety at home. More Peaceful Winter Days: Ultra-quiet heating delivers calm, cozy warmth that eases your mood throughout the day, with noise as low as 37.5 dB, much quieter than a library. Huge Savings on Energy: With 5 modes (1500W/900W/700W/ECO/Fan Only), you're allowed to tune the heat as you like to save more on energy bills. In ECO Mode, you can define the exact heat you desire from 41 to 95°F in 1°F increments. Easy Touch, Easy Carry: More precise temperature display on the panel and more handy control from the remote. Hidden carry handle at the back makes this portable heater effortless to carry and store whenever needed. Washable, Detachable Filter and Carry Effortlessly. Cord Lenth: 6 ft / 1.8 m","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Jk5gobw2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dreo","source_asin":"B096M85BSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1162684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096M85BSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096M85BSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
