window.products.push({"id":1162852,"name":"MeMoreCool Folding Mattress 4-Inch Memory Foam Foldable Mattress, Tri-Folding Mattress Futon/Camp/Travel Mattress Topper, Portable Mattress Floor Bed ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810lty4SzbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Save More Space & Easy To Store]The foldable design saves more space in your home. Foldable mattress measures 38 \"x78 \"x4\" in the flat position. Measures 38 \"x26 \"x12\" when folded. 4\" tri-fold mattress includes a super soft and washable ribbed fur cover. [2 in 1 Cushion & Mattress Design]2 in 1 Cushion & Mattress Design: The foldable mattress can not only be used as a temporary mattress for guests, floor beds, camping, doing yoga, etc. It can also be used as a separate floor cushion with a convenient carrying handle. The middle zipper can be opened into 3 separate cushions. [Comfortable & Supportive Foam]The memory foam foldable mattress combines high-quality foam material with advanced sleeping technology. The responsive foam fits your body, it allows you to release body pressure as quickly as possible to get a perfect sleep experience. All of our foams have a superior high density construction that does not lose its shape and it provides a comfortable medium firm supportive feel. [Upgraded Breathable Cover]The memory foam floor mattress is 4''thick, soft, breathable, and quick to fold. This mattress comes with a super soft and plush fur cover which makes it perfect for bedtime snuggles. The cover is removable and washable for your convenience. [Services Experience ] Whether it is used as a mattress or cushion, MeMoreCool is very confident about the experience of the product. Comfort comes first. If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us, we will find the best solution for every customer. NOTE: Please allow up to 72 hours for the mattress to fully expand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810lty4SzbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MeMoreCool","source_asin":"B0B38YZGSZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1162852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B38YZGSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B38YZGSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1162853,"name":"HyperChiller EBC-1023RG 2-Pack Patented Coffee Beverage Cooler, Ready in One Minute, Reusable for Iced Tea, Wine, Spirits, Alcohol, Juice, 12.5 OZ, Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VCaTNJhiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Save time no need to wait around for cold brew or waste 15 minutes going to the coffee shop each day. Results in one minute you can turn fresh hot coffee into perfect iced coffee in as quickly as one minute! The hyper chiller can cool by up to 130+ degrees in 60 seconds without dilution. Save money the average iced coffee will run you 3-4 dollars. It can pay for itself in just two weeks! Compatible with any brew method it is designed to conveniently fit into most full size single cup brewers, has a high-volume 12.5 Oz capacity and a deep lid for easy use with any traditional method. Dishwasher safe the hyper chiller has four simple parts, easily disassembles and is machine washable. Other uses use it to chill a bottle of wine, your favorite whiskey or some iced tea. The hyper chiller cools all liquids without any change in flavor or dilution! How it works: - To assemble: just add water and freeze. Once frozen, pour fresh coffee from carafe (or brew directly from compatible single cup brewer) into the lid. - One minute after your fresh hot coffee is inside, it will be chilled by up to 130+ degrees - without dilution! - then just pour into your regular drinking glass or mug, & put the hyper chiller back in the freezer for next time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VCaTNJhiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HyperChiller","source_asin":"B09T5DD44R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1162853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T5DD44R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T5DD44R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
